  ARRAY['Google Project Management Certificate', 'PMP', 'NASSCOM FutureSkills Digital Leadership'],
  ARRAY['Design a citizen-facing app redesign for a government service (e.g., ration card portal)', 'Write a policy note on India''s ONDC vs Amazon/Flipkart', 'Map the end-to-end user journey for a government scheme application process'],
