-- 17. CDS Officer
(
  'Armed Forces & Paramilitary',
  'CDS Officer (Combined Defence Services)',
  'cds-officer',
  'Serve the nation in uniform — through the UPSC Combined Defence Services exam.',
  'CDS is UPSC''s own exam for entry into the Indian Army, Navy, and Air Force as commissioned officers. For UPSC-CSE aspirants under 24 (or OTA under 25), this is a near-perfect pivot. The preparation overlaps significantly — GK, English, and mathematical reasoning — and the IMA/OTA path offers a prestigious career with excellent perks.',
  '₹8 LPA', '₹13 LPA', '₹20 LPA',
  ARRAY['Government housing', 'Full healthcare for family', 'Pension', 'Prestigious posting opportunities', 'Pre-commission training at IMA/OTA'],
  'Serve and protect India''s sovereignty. Lead soldiers in the world''s second-largest standing army.',
